					"id": 400110702,
					"content": "Huh? What's this?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110703,
					"content": "Look at these stacked-up stones and small flowers...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110704,
					"content": "It feels like a memorial for someone.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110705,
						400110706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110705,
					"content": "You're very perceptive.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110707
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400110707,
					"content": "Hey, you're embarrassing me...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110708,
					"content": "But the only other thing around here is that machine in Inazuman clothing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110709,
					"content": "Could the memorial be for the machine?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110710,
					"content": "Perhaps it once performed some deed that merited a memorial.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110711,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110712,
					"content": "Everything we've seen here indicates that there was once a human presence in these waters. Still, there isn't enough for us to infer what kind of civilization it was.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110713,
					"content": "And up to now, we still have yet to see any people or gravestones.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110714,
					"content": "Master Jean, can I go over there and have a look?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110715,
					"content": "Yes, but be careful!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110716,
					"content": "Okay!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110717,
					"content": "How many secrets do these islands hold?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110718
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400110718,
					"content": "Klee is too young to have a proper sense of danger. Traveler, the rest of us must stay alert to the situation.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110719,
					"content": "Honestly speaking, I thought that letter was only a prank at first.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110720,
					"content": "That's what we thought.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110721,
					"content": "I suspected as much too, but who would send a prank letter to a child?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110722,
					"content": "A letter that guides us to activate mechanisms on a deserted archipelago... It's bizarre.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110723,
					"content": "It makes me wonder whether this isn't some kind of trap, long in the making. We must keep our guard up.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110724
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110724,
					"content": "Miss Barbara!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110725,
					"content": "Klee, what's wrong?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110726
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110726,
					"content": "Do you think that Dodo-King doesn't want to see Klee?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110727,
					"content": "Why would the Dodo-King not want to see you, Klee?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110728,
					"content": "Dodoco loves me, an—and I love Dodoco, so Dodo-King can never separate us. That's why Dodo-King doesn't want to see us...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110729,
					"content": "*whimper* Klee doesn't want him to separate us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110730
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110730,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110731
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110731,
					"content": "Hey Klee, do you know what this is?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110732,
					"content": "It's a harpastum!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110733
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110733,
					"content": "I heard my big sis— Uh, Master Jean say that Klee always wanted to play harpastum, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110734
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110734,
					"content": "Yeah! Klee was just thinking about Ludi Harpastum!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110735
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110735,
					"content": "I made this harpastum especially for you. Now every day can be Ludi Harpastum, hee-hee!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110736
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110736,
					"content": "Yay!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110737
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110737,
					"content": "The kindness of a deaconess...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110738
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400110738,
					"content": "So keep your chin up, Klee! After we meet Dodo-King, we can all help you convince him to let you and Dodoco stay together.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110739
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbara"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110739,
					"content": "Okay!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110740
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110740,
					"content": "Let's double our efforts. We have to find him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110741
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400110741,
					"content": "Yeah!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110742
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110742,
					"content": "Leave it to us Klee. This Dodo-jerk can't hide forever.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110743
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110743,
					"content": "Even if it takes a thousand years and a thousand searches... uh, w—we'll get him! Ahem...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110744
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110744,
					"content": "But until then, let's have a good look around the area!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110706,
					"content": "That's a deaconess's intuition, alright!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110707
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4001109,
